.* WRKLIB: the libraries a name selects, with their options. The first
.* entry is blank: option 1 there creates a library.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=LIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=LIBATR CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=ASPDEV CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=LIBTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=LIBS VARS='OPT LIB LIBATR ASPDEV LIBTEXT'.
:KEYL NAME=WLKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=Display names only
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='RETURN 16'.F16=Repeat position to
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION='RETURN 17'.F17=Position to
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKLIB KEYL=WLKEYS HELP=WRKLIB ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE.Work with Libraries
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=LIBS VIEWS=2.(No libraries selected)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='RETURN 1'.1=Create
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD ?CHGLIB LIB(&LIB.)'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=3 ENTER='CMD ?CPYLIB FROMLIB(&LIB.)'.3=Copy
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD ?DLTLIB LIB(&LIB.)'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD DSPLIB LIB(&LIB.)'.5=Display
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='CMD DSPLIB LIB(&LIB.) OUTPUT(*PRINT)'.6=Print
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD DSPOBJD OBJ(QSYS/&LIB.) OBJTYPE(*LIB)'.8=Display library description
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ENTER='CMD ?SAVLIB LIB(&LIB.)'.9=Save
:LISTACT OPTION=10 ENTER='CMD ?RSTLIB SAVLIB(&LIB.)'.10=Restore
:LISTACT OPTION=11 ENTER='CMD ?SAVCHGOBJ LIB(&LIB.)'.11=Save changed objects
:LISTACT OPTION=12 ENTER='CMD WRKOBJ OBJ(&LIB./*ALL)'.12=Work with objects
:LISTACT OPTION=14 ENTER='CMD ?CLRLIB LIB(&LIB.)'.14=Clear
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=LIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=LIBATR USAGE=OUTPUT.Attribute
:LISTGRP COL=ASPGRP.ASP
:LISTCOL VAR=ASPDEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Device
:ELISTGRP.
:LISTCOL VAR=LIBTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT LIB LIBATR ASPGRP LIBTEXT'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT LIB'.
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Parameters for options 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, 9, 10, 11 and 12 or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKLIB.Work with Libraries - Help
:P.The libraries the name selects. Type an option next to a library;
option 1 on the blank first line, with a name typed on the command
line, creates one. F17 positions the list at the name on the command
line; F11 shows the names alone.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
